<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Hesitations - Acoustic</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">LRN Slime, CORBAL, Shiloh Dynasty</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">17</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2ssA3XhNmqLz1qeORv6Z0N</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.320" end="00:18.430">Situations bring you back to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.430" end="00:22.980">Oh, lovers never break up, I guess you want that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.980" end="00:26.850">So in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.850" end="00:31.140">You say that I'm dying to forget, I bit the bullet for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.140" end="00:34.800">For you, I wrote a song, too many, plenty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.800" end="00:38.890">So I hope you really know that I been thinking 'bout you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.890" end="00:46.520">Oh, thinking 'bout you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.520" end="00:49.880">When it's dark out, I'm the one you need, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.880" end="00:54.250">Listen to the beating of your heart's song, heart's song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.250" end="00:57.520">When it's dark out, I'm the one you need, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.520" end="01:02.810">Listen to the beating of your heart's song, song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.810" end="01:06.620">Da-dum, da-dum, mm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.620" end="01:10.590">Da-dum, da-dum, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.590" end="01:16.770">Da-dum, da-dum, mm, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.770" end="01:20.850">Never give up on your love for me, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.850" end="01:25.240">I'm unforgettable, you'll see, you'll see me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.240" end="01:32.110">Oh no, I'm all yours, I'm all yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.110" end="01:38.650">Oh-oh-oh, ooh, you didn't notice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.650" end="01:46.650">Oh, you should know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.900" end="01:51.280">When it's dark out, I'm the one you need, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.280" end="01:55.660">Listen to the beating of your heart's song, heart's song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.660" end="01:59.080">When it's dark out, I'm the one you need, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.080" end="02:04.140">Listen to the beating of your heart's song, song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.140" end="02:08.180">Da-dum, da-dum, mm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.180" end="02:11.920">Da-dum, da-dum, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.920" end="02:19.450">Da-dum, da-dum, mm, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.450" end="02:23.160">And there's a question that I'll never ask</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.160" end="02:26.910">No one to help me when I'm feeling bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.910" end="02:28.960">Hesitation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.960" end="02:32.660">Hesitation, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.660" end="02:36.440">You gotta know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.440" end="02:40.080">I've been a mess since I met you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.080" end="02:45.140">I'm stuck in a mood tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.140" end="02:49.390">Oh (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.390" end="02:52.720">When it's dark out, I'm the one you need, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.720" end="02:57.040">Listen to the beating of your heart's song, heart's song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.040" end="03:00.480">When it's dark out, I'm the one you need, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.480" end="03:05.550">Listen to the beating of your heart's song, song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.550" end="03:09.530">Da-dum, da-dum, mm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.530" end="03:13.430">Da-dum, da-dum, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.430" end="03:18.180">Da-dum, da-dum, mm, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.180" end="03:22.180" /></div></body></tt>